00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:35.000
Along with Huggy Rao, Bob is co-author of The Friction Project, how smart leaders make the right things easier and the wrong things harder. Bob and Huggy argue that every organization, from corner convenience stores to international aid agencies, can be plagued by destructive friction. Bob, I want to talk about a source of friction that we see in public policy all the time. You talk about a system in Michigan

