where residents were applying for government assistance but found it very difficult to do so. Tell me what was happening, Bob. So, there's a class that I've been teaching for years with some colleagues that's called Design Leadership. And what we do is we take a pair of students and we link them to a company or a nonprofit and help them solve a little problem.

