And it's much easier for Michigan residents now to complete that form. I mean, I have to confess that every year when tax day rolls around, I feel exactly the same thing about the tax code, which is that I think of myself as a reasonably smart person, but I find it genuinely incomprehensible and almost deliberately so. Oh yes. And very often, I think that happens that no individual who assembles those forms wants to do it to us, but every person wants to add their little thing that makes them happy. That's one of the problems there.

