so excited that he sort of ripped it out of the developers' hands and gave the technology to some of the most famous people in the world. And then very quickly, all the technology reviews and all the people tried to use it had battery life problems. It actually had a whole bunch of reliability problems. Oh, it had privacy problems. That was another issue. And so they ended up sort

