of pulling it from the market. And the technology reviews, one in particular was this is one of the worst technology projects ever made. And to us, the reason that's a lesson, and especially this idea of people who are in power sometimes don't face enough friction. His team did try to tell him that they didn't think it was a very good idea, but they kind of couldn't stop him because he had the power to rip it out of their hands and to put it into the marketplace. And there's also a sort of a postscript to that

43
