00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:41.000
So, yes, to me, that's a hallmark of creative teams. -♪ You also talk about how sometimes the longer we go through an experience, the more meaningful the experience becomes to us, which is a very interesting psychological idea where the more friction we have, the more engaged we might feel. So talk about that idea, Bob. Well, this is, you know so much about psychology, it's ridiculous.

